, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بَيْنَهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَأَسَرُّوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/aca6f1cda3eb1d4bcc48.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i tajili su", "en": "and they kept secret", "tr": "ve gizlediler", "fr": "et ils tinrent secret", "id": "dan mereka merahasiakan", "ur": "اور انہوں نے چھپایا", "bn": "এবং তারা গোপন রাখল", "fa": "و پنهان داشتند"}}, {"text": "ٱلنَّجْوَىٰ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "2:77", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/84.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Are they then unaware that Allah knoweth that which they keep hidden and that which they proclaim?", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Peki bilmezler mi ki, onlar neyi sır olarak saklar ve neyi açıkça söylerlerse Allah hepsini bilir.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "کیا تم نہیں جانتے کہ اللہ جانتا ہے جو کچھ وہ چھپاتے ہیں اور جو کچھ ظاہر کرتے ہیں-", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Tidakkah mereka mengetahui bahwa Allah mengetahui segala yang mereka sembunyikan dan segala yang mereka nyatakan?", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "أَوَلَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَعْلَمُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَنَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَعْلَمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يُسِرُّونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/641789c3e5fee06af292.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "they keep secret", "bs": "taje", "tr": "gizlerler", "fr": "ils gardent le secret", "id": "mereka merahasiakan", "ur": "وہ راز رکھتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা গোপন রাখে", "fa": "پنهان می‌دارند"}}, {"text": "وَمَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يُعْلِنُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "16:19", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1920.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And Allah knoweth that which ye keep hidden and that which ye proclaim.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Allah, gizlediğinizi de açıkladığınızı da bilir.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور اللہ جانتا ہے جو چھپاتے اور ظاہر کرتے ہو،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan Allah mengetahui apa yang kamu rahasiakan dan apa yang kamu lahirkan.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَعْلَمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تُسِرُّونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/0e58cb62d60c1087c7d6.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "tajite", "en": "you conceal", "tr": "gizlersiniz", "fr": "vous dissimulez", "id": "kamu menyembunyikan", "ur": "تم چھپاتے ہو", "bn": "তোমরা গোপন রাখো", "fa": "پنهان می‌دارید"}}, {"text": "وَمَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تُعْلِنُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "67:13", "tense": "imperative", "category": {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5254.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And keep your opinion secret or proclaim it, lo! He is Knower of all that is in the breasts (of men).", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Sözünüzü ister gizleyin, ister açığa vurun; bilin ki, O, göğüslerin özünü bilir.", "by": "E